  "_doc": {
    "about": "What each racer style is built around, in the same vocabulary as part_semantics.json. 'core' = the mechanic the style's traits reward (the planner treats it as the primary scoring axis). 'grants' = statuses the style itself supplies via traits or its multiplayer starting ability, so consumer parts for them are 'free'. 'mechanics' = play patterns the style pushes you into (so parts triggered by them fire often). Derived from racer_style_traits + racer_style_abilities; adjust by hand as needed.",
    "modes": "Campaign styles have rank 1-3 trait sets; multiplayer has a fixed set plus a starting ability. The planner reads traits per mode from the DB; this file only adds the interpretation."
